hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1894","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Allah Taala ne apne Rasool par wafat se pehle (wahi) lagatar ki yahan tak ke Us ne Aap ko wafat di, sab se zyada wahi usi waqt thi, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke baad wafat pa gaye."
"1895","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Yahud mein se ek shakhs ne un se kaha: Ae Ameerul Momineen! Tumhari kitab mein ek ayat hai jise tum parhte ho, agar hum par, Yahud ki jamaat par, nazil hoti to hum us din ko eid banate, unhon ne kaha: Kaun si ayat? Us ne kaha: (Aaj main ne tumhare liye tumhara deen mukammal kiya aur tum par apni nemat poori ki aur tumhare liye Islam ko deen pasand kiya), Umar ne kaha: Hum us din aur us jagah ko jan chuke jismein wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par nazil hui jabke Aap Arafa mein khade they, Juma ke din."
"1896","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Urwa ibn al-Zubair ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Aisha se Allah Taala ke qaul (Aur agar daro) se (aur chaar) tak ke bare mein poocha, phir unhon ne kaha: Ae meri behen ke bete! Wo yateem larki hai jo apne sarparast ki parwarish mein hoti hai, us ke maal mein us ke sath shareek hoti hai, phir use us ka maal aur husn pasand aata hai aur us ka sarparast chahta hai ke use nikah mein laye baghair is ke ke us ke meher mein insaf kare, phir use waisa de jaisa us ke siwa dega, phir unhe mana kiya gaya ke unhe nikah mein layein magar ye ke un ke liye insaf karein aur unhe meher ki un ki aala sunnat tak pahunchayein, aur unhe hukm diya gaya ke un ke siwa aurton mein se jo unhe achhi lagein nikah karein, Aisha ne kaha: Phir logon ne is ayat ke baad Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se fatwa manga to Allah ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Aur wo tum se aurton mein fatwa mangte hain) is qaul tak: (Aur tum chaho ke unhe nikah mein lao), aur jo Allah ne zikr kiya ke tum par kitab mein parha jata hai, pehli ayat jis mein farmaya: (Aur agar daro ke yateemon mein insaf na karoge to aurton mein se jo tumhe achhi lagein nikah karo), Aisha ne kaha: Aur doosri ayat mein Allah ka qaul: (Aur tum chaho ke unhe nikah mein lao) yaani wo tum mein se ek ki raghbat hai apni yateem ke liye jo us ki parwarish mein hoti hai jab wo kam maal aur husn wali ho, phir unhe mana kiya gaya ke wo yateem aurton mein se jin ke maal aur husn ki raghbat rakhein nikah karein, magar insaf ke sath, un ki un se beraghbati ki wajah se."
"1897","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: (Aur jo ghani ho use chahiye ke bache, aur jo faqeer ho use chahiye ke maaruf se khaye) yateem ke sarparast ke bare mein nazil hui jo us par qayam ho aur us ke maal mein islah kare, agar faqeer ho to us mein se maaruf se khaye."
"1898","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se (Aur agar aurat apne shohar se sarkashi ya berukhi ka dar rakhe) ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mard hota hai jis ke paas aurat hoti hai jis se wo zyada faida na uthata ho, wo use juda karna chahta hai, phir wo kehti hai: Main tumhe apne mamle mein halal karti hun, phir ye ayat is bare mein nazil hui."
"1899","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Saeed bin Jubair ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek ayat jismein Kufa wale ikhtilaf karte they, phir main us mein Ibn Abbas ki taraf safar karke aaya aur un se us ke bare mein poocha, phir unhon ne kaha: Ye ayat nazil hui: (Aur jo momin ko jan boojh kar qatl kare to us ka badla Jahannam hai), wo sab se aakhir nazil hui aur use kisi cheez ne mansookh nahi kiya."
"1900","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, Ibn Abza ne kaha: Ibn Abbas se Allah Taala ke qaul (Aur jo momin ko jan boojh kar qatl kare to us ka badla Jahannam hai), aur Us ke qaul (Aur wo us jaan ko qatl nahi karte jise Allah ne haram kiya magar Haq ke sath) yahan tak ke (magar jo tauba kare) tak ke bare mein poocha gaya, phir main ne un se poocha aur unhon ne kaha: Jab ye nazil hui to Makkah wale ne kaha: Phir hum ne Allah ke barabar tehraya aur us jaan ko qatl kiya jise Allah ne haram kiya magar Haq ke sath, aur fawahish kiye, phir Allah ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Magar jo tauba kare aur iman laye aur nek amal kare) is qaul tak: (bakhshne wala rehem wala)."
"1901","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) se (Aur us se na kaho jo tumhe salam de ke tum momin nahi ho) ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs apni chhoti bakriyon mein tha, phir musalman use ja mile aur us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, phir unhon ne use qatl kar diya aur us ki chhoti bakriyan le lein, phir Allah ne is bare mein is qaul tak nazil farmaya: (Duniya ki zindagi ka saman), wo chhoti bakriyan thein."
"1902","[AI-translation] Hazrat al-Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye ayat hamare bare mein nazil hui, Ansar jab hajj karte aur aate to apne gharon ke darwazon se dakhil na hote lekin un ke peeche se, phir Ansar mein se ek shakhs aaya aur apne darwaze se dakhil hua, phir goya use is se aar dilayi gayi, phir (ye ayat) nazil hui: (Aur neki ye nahi ke gharon mein un ke peeche se aao lekin neki jo taqwa ikhtiyar kare, aur gharon mein un ke darwazon se aao)."
"1903","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se (Apne Rab tak waseela) ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Insaano mein se kuch log jinno mein se kuch logon ki ibadat karte they, phir jinn musalman hue aur ye apne deen par qaim rahe."
"1904","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Saeed bin Jubair ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Sura Tauba? Unhon ne kaha: Tauba ruswa karne wali hai, wo nazil hoti rahi: (Aur un mein se, aur un mein se), yahan tak ke unhon ne samajha ke wo un mein se kisi ko na chhodegi magar us ka zikr us mein hoga, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Sura Anfal? Unhon ne kaha: Badr mein nazil hui, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Sura Hashr? Unhon ne kaha: Banu Nadir mein nazil hui."
"1905","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se Ibn Umar ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke minbar par khutba diya aur farmaya: Beshak sharaab ki hurmat nazil hui hai jabke wo paanch cheezon se hai: Angoor, khajoor, gehun, jau aur shehed se, aur sharaab jo aql ko dhanke, aur teen hain, main chahta tha ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hum se juda na hon yahan tak ke hum se ehad kar jatein: Dada (ki meeras), kalala aur sood ke darwazon mein se darwaze."
"1906","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se Qais ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zarr ko qasam khate suna, beshak ye ayat: (Ye do jhagadne wale jinhon ne apne Rab mein jhagda kiya) un mein nazil hui jo Badr ke din nikle: Hamza, Ali, Ubaida bin al-Haris, aur Utba, Shaiba bin Rabi ke bete, aur Walid bin Utba."
